# Geo SDK Environment Variables
# -----------------------------

# Your Smart Wallet Private Key (from https://www.geobrowser.io/export-wallet)
PK_SW="0x<PASTE_YOUR_PRIVATE_KEY_HERE>"

# The ID of the space you want to publish to (e.g., your personal space ID)
DEMO_SPACE_ID="<PASTE_YOUR_SPACE_ID_HERE>"
